OL,3,AGermany's far-right AfD bids for first
OL,4,Ataste of power in eastern vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FGermany is holding its breath this
OL,7,Fweekend as there is a seismic election
OL,8,Fin the country's east.
OL,10,FThe Alternative fur Deutschland party
OL,11,Fis aiming to secure a majority in the
OL,12,Fregional parliament of Saxony-Anhalt.
OL,14,FAn outright win would mark the first
OL,15,Ftime a far-right party has held
OL,16,Fstate-level power in the nation's
OL,17,Fpost-war era.
OL,19,FFor the AfD's opponents, this is a
OL,20,Fpoint of serious peril. But the party
OL,21,Fsees it as a stepping stone towards its
OL,22,Fdreams of nationwide power.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
